  "note": "DoDonPachi DaiOuJou vertical as the core gives it (PGM, 448 x 224 turned, shown 3:4, game pixels twice as wide as tall); the deck canvas uses rows of 2 game lines, like the game's own 8 x 16 figures. The rail is always filled: plates in reserve come back when there is room (recipe.fit), the rest is shared between the rows. Deck pixel auto (H-D25): the game pixel while every plate fits, half a pixel otherwise, with the fonts of skin.half doubled so the text keeps its size; the controller always stays (bottom right).",
